{"id":"bello","lemma":"bello","pos":"adj","rank":204,"glosses":["nice, fair, fine, pleasant; beautiful (of the weather, etc.)","good-looking, handsome; beautiful (of a person)","considerable (quantity)"],"ipa":"/ˈbɛl.lo/","forms":{"feminine":"bella","masculinePlural":"belli","femininePlural":"belle"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-bello.wav","formAudio":{"bella":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-Jennum-bella.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Bello parlare con te.","en":"Nice talking with you.","words":[null,{"g":"to talk, to speak"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"you, thee"}]},{"text":"Questo posto è davvero bello.","en":"This place is really nice.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"really, in fact"},null]},{"text":"Questi sono belli.","en":"These are beautiful.","words":[{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"Sarebbe bello farlo.","en":"It would be nice to do that.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,null]},{"text":"È bello avere molti amici.","en":"It is nice to have a lot of friends.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"to have"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot","l":"molto"},{"g":"friend","l":"amico"}]}]}